# Empty patches/ directory for future tinyhat-specific diffs against
# OpenAI Codex CLI.
#
# When the tinyhat platform needs to apply a small fix on top of the
# vendored upstream (e.g. the watchdog hook, IdentityContext
# rendering, sandbox-network policy override), drop the patch file
# here as `NNNN-tinyhat-<short-name>.patch` and reference it in
# HARNESS.md so an external reader can see what we changed and why.
#
# At the v1 launch this directory is empty — the wrapper applies no
# patches.
